  "description": "Combining uncompromising performance with legendary toughness, this is the bike that the likes of Caleb Holonko rely on to define the edge of what’s possible. Top tier, super-tunable RockShox suspension is paired with the uncluttered precision of SRAM’s AXS drivetrain for a surefooted magic carpet ride regardless of terrain or conditions. DT Swiss hubs keep the wheels rolling smooth for the long haul. Flip-chip convenience lets you choose whether those smooth rolling wheels are 29ers or a mullet setup. Bombproof carbon fiber construction ensures peace of mind and provides deep dropper extension for maximum steezability. Find your limits. Then demolish them.",
